  "note": "Bittele (7pcb.com) is a Toronto-headquartered turnkey PCB/PCBA company with facilities in Shenzhen and Penang; the pages do not say which plant fabricates bare boards. Its PCB specifications PDF (address: Markham, post-2019) gives the floors used here; the 3/3 mil headline is kept in advanced-o because the per-copper-weight table puts 1 oz at 4 mil width / 5 mil space. The stackup PDF is '(c) Copyright 2012' with the older North York address - it is the only stackup document linked from the current site. Pages read with curl + browser user agent and PDFs with procurement pdf-text/pdf-table on 2026-10-17.",
  "retrieved_utc": "2026-10-17T00:00:00Z",
