  "barrel_plating-s": "minimum",
  "barrel_plating_source-s": "Bittele PCB specifications PDF p3, plating table with columns 'Min.Thickness Max.Thickness': 'Copper Plating Hole (micron) | Copper Thickness | 20um | 30um' -> 20 um minimum, 30 um maximum (no IPC class stated). https://www.7pcb.com/Upload_file/PCB-specifications.pdf, read 2026-10-17",
  "copper_foil_note-s": "not published (foil type, roughness). Impedance page: 'Copper foil: 1/3 oz, 1/2 oz, 1 oz, 2 oz, 3 oz' kept in stock and a preference for foil-built constructions; the standard stackup PDF prints every layer (outer included) as 0.0014\" / 1 oz with no base-foil/plating split. https://www.7pcb.com/Impedance-controlled-PCB, https://www.7pcb.com/Upload_file/Multi-layer-stack-up.pdf, read 2026-10-17",
  "laminate_df_note-s": "no Df and no laminate brand for the standard stackups; every dielectric printed with Dielectric Constant 4.2 (frequency not stated). Spec lists FR4 Tg130/170, IT180A. https://www.7pcb.com/Upload_file/Multi-layer-stack-up.pdf, read 2026-10-17",
